# Keep local, host-specific and secret material OFF Vercel. Without this the Vercel CLI uploads the
# whole working tree (it does NOT honour .gitignore for uploads), which put windrow.env — and its
# WINDROW_CENTRAL_DB_URL=localhost — on the function, where config.js loaded it and overrode the
# Supabase DATABASE_URL. It would also have shipped the enrollment CA private keys under server/data.
#
# The demo function needs api/, server/ (minus data), client/dist (built in the cloud) and vercel.json.

# Local host config + secrets
windrow.env
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# The node's data dir: SQLite, the enrollment CA private key, issued credentials — never deploy this.
server/data
server/**/data

# Local-only tooling and scratch
scripts/demo-local.js
docs/design/secrets-audit-*.md

# Backups / archives
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
